sequenceDiagram
    participant GateEE as Remote Gate (eu-ee31)
    participant GateFI as eFTI Gate (eu-fi01, receiving)
    participant Handler as GateMessageHandler
    participant EftiSvc as EftiService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over GateEE: Remote gate eu-ee31 has received a<br/>search request and is broadcasting to all gates.

    GateEE->>+GateFI: eDelivery AS4 / Fast HTTP: IdentifierQueryRequest
    Note over GateEE,GateFI: X-API-Key: eu-ee31<br/>Body: &lt;identifierQuery requestId="req-b2c3d4e5"&gt;<br/>  &lt;identifier&gt;456XYZ&lt;/identifier&gt;<br/>  &lt;registrationCountryCode&gt;FI&lt;/registrationCountryCode&gt;<br/>&lt;/identifierQuery&gt;

    GateFI->>+Handler: handleMessage(payload)
    Handler->>Handler: Parse message type → IdentifierQuery

    Handler->>+EftiSvc: handleIdentifierQuery(payload)
    EftiSvc->>EftiSvc: Parse IdentifiersQuery from XML
    EftiSvc->>+DB: SELECT * FROM consignments c<br/>JOIN identifiers i ON i.datasetId = c.datasetId<br/>WHERE i.id = '456XYZ' AND i.countryCode = 'FI'
    DB-->>-EftiSvc: 1 consignment (datasetId=a1b2c3d4-...)

    EftiSvc->>EftiSvc: Wrap result in identifierResponse XML
    EftiSvc-->>-Handler: "&lt;identifierResponse status='200' requestId='req-b2c3d4e5'&gt;&lt;ed:consignment&gt;...&lt;/ed:consignment&gt;&lt;/identifierResponse&gt;"

    Handler-->>-GateFI: response payload

    GateFI-->>-GateEE: eDelivery AS4 / Fast HTTP Response\n&lt;identifierResponse status="200" requestId="req-b2c3d4e5"&gt;...

    GateEE->>GateEE: Parse GateIdentifiersResponse<br/>Extract ConsignmentXml objects<br/>Set identifierCountryOfOrigin = "FI"

    GateEE->>GateEE: send(GateIdentifiersResponse(gateId="eu-fi01", consignments=[...]))<br/>→ SSE stream to original authority user

    alt Gate unreachable / timeout
        GateEE->>GateFI: IdentifierQueryRequest
        GateFI--xGateEE: Connection timeout / error
        GateEE->>GateEE: catch(e: Exception)<br/>log.warn("eu-fi01 failed with $e")
        GateEE->>GateEE: send(GateIdentifiersResponse(gateId="eu-fi01", consignments=null, failure=e.message))<br/>→ SSE: event:gate data:{"gateId":"eu-fi01","failure":"Connect timeout"}
    end
